Awhile ago someone posted an article remarking that it would be "neat"
to see what happens if you ran across your own bones level and attempted 
to bring the corpse back to life. Recently, I came across a bones level
with the same character class and attempted to bring it back to life. 
This was attempted using the turn undead spell. From this experience
I can say that nothing happens; the corpse just disappears. My previous
assumption was that a monster class "player" would be generated. As a side
note the lizard corpse in the pile did come back to life.


